      :variations ["Single global destructor vs per-branch ordered saga chain"]
      :failureModes ["Cleanup handler exception swallowing (mitigated: explicit error reporting)"]
      :adr "ADR-0056"
      :decision "D56"
      :why "Guarantee zero irreversible mutations and zero orphan processes on aborted branches"
      :spec "Implement compensating action registration and execution on branch abort."
